<p>To the first part, that was me changing one half of the sentence and forgetting to change the other half. The streak continues, I always seem do that at least once per article.</p>
<p>As far as the distasteful and fetishy bit&#8230; Well, yes. That's half the point. It's a thing to use to change animals into people, or at least most of the way. We're not sure why it was made in the first place, whether intentions was particularly benign or sadistic, but we know that MC&amp;D looked at it and said &quot;Hey, you know, we know some folks that like pretty weird shit&#8230;&quot;</p>
<p>And yes, in retrospect, the latter half of the note was a bit Lolfoundation, I excised it and tightened a little.</p>

